abstract: "SSATK is a Python toolkit for space situational awareness and astrodynamics: orbit and 6-DoF spacecraft propagation, impulsive and continuous-thrust transfer design, coordinate and time frames, space-environment models, conjunction screening and orbit determination, standard orbit-data formats, and visualization."
keywords:
  - orbital mechanics
  - astrodynamics
  - space situational awareness
  - visualization
  - orbit propagation
  - spacecraft dynamics
